101 local compatibility build: source-map-js 1.2.2+101.1

Derived from the SHA512-pinned upstream source-map-js1.2.2 npm archive.
Original Mozilla Foundation/contributor copyright and BSD-3-Clause conditions
are retained in LICENSE and the unchanged source headers.

Local changes preserve absent sourceRoot conversion, zero-column section
selection, first-local-line column offsets, first mapping names and public
nested reverse lookup. Optional original source content remains optional.
Generated-only indexed mappings retain null sources during iteration/conversion.
The upstream1.2.2 malformed and accumulated-offset checks are retained.
This is a local101 build, not an upstream release or support promise.
